    "text": "Home\nBid Events\nAuction Events\nAgency\nAdmin\nEKENEU \u23f7\nRFQ2026-05 (Janitorial Products)Issued\nNOT SUBMITTED - To complete your response, you must click 'Submit Response' in the Response Submission tab.\nClosing in 3 days 23 hours 37 minutes 54 seconds\nActions\n \nType\nRequest for Qualifications\nQuestion Cut Off\n6/22/26 @ 11:00am\nDate Issued\n6/5/26 @ 11:48am\nDate Closing\n6/30/26 @ 4:00pm\nDescription\nThe City of St. Joseph, Missouri is seeking statements of qualifications to establish a qualified vendor listing for\u00a0the supply and delivery of high-volume consumable janitorial products for all City facilities.\n\n\u00a0\nProposals must be submitted electronically through the City of St. Joseph's electronic bidding system as it helps to expedite the bidding process and alleviate errors. No paper, emailed, or faxed submissions will be accepted.\n\nThe City of St. Joseph reserves the right to reject any or all bids. The City of St. Joseph is an Equal Opportunity Employer.\n\t\t\n22\nMon, Jun 2026\nQuestion Cut ...\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\n5\nFri, Jun 2026\nAdvertiseme...\nBid Issue\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n30\nTue, Jun 2026\nBid Close\nEvent Details\nQuestions\nActivities\nAttachments\nAttributes\nResponse Attachments\nResponse Submission\nBid Attachments\n#\tDownload All\tFile Name\tDescription\n\n1\n\u00a02 items in 1 pages\n\n1\tDownload\tRequest for Qualifications- Janitorial Products RFQ2026-05.pdf (124\u00a0KB)\tRequest for Qualifications- Janitorial Products RFQ2026-05\n2\tDownload\tW-9 Form.pdf (116\u00a0KB)\tW-9 Form"
